id: lesson.thermal_api_shape
category: lesson
status: verified
date: ''
content: 'Thermal API returns {gpu: {...}, cpu: {...}, regulation_count, history},
  not {gpus: [...]}. Frontend must match this shape.'
notes: Discovered when ThermalPanel crashed with 'cannot read properties of undefined
  (reading length)'.
