id: lesson.skills_api_shape
category: lesson
status: verified
date: ''
content: 'Skills API returns {skills: [...]} when skill manager is active, {error:
  ...} when inactive. Frontend must extract the array and handle errors.'
notes: Discovered when SkillsPanel crashed with 'e.map is not a function'.
